designer_notes = "THE FIRST RANGED FOE (Luke's F1, 2026-11-12, FOES_PREP.md section 6). Its question: can you reach it, or roll its arrow? It stands 9 to 14 m off in sight and draws 1200 ms (the pose, then a glint), the aim locked the last 250 ms, no leading. Come within 4 m and it steps back 5 m, at most once every 6 s; caught, it shoves. 1800 ms between shots. It never staggers you and never shoots what it cannot see. All numbers are first guesses, Luke's to change."
